# Named Styles

Named styles live in front-matter. Authors apply them with `:::` containers.

::: callout

**Important:** This is rendered with the `callout` style — a warm background,
warm border, and comfortable padding. No CSS selectors; just a name.

:::

Some prose between blocks.

::: highlight

A different named style with a cool background and tighter padding.

:::
